[%-
  # ── Your library: change the values on these two lines only. ───────────────────────────────────────────
  library_name = branch.branchname;  # leave it like this to use the library name you have in Koha
  footer_note  = "";                 # one line under the signature, e.g. your opening hours; "" = none
  USE Koha;
-%]
[% IF borrower.firstname %]Dear [% borrower.firstname %],[% ELSE %]Hello,[% END %]

Reserved for you and ready to collect:
----

* [% hold.biblio.title | $Remove_MARC_punctuation | trim %][% IF hold.biblio.author %], [% hold.biblio.author | $Remove_MARC_punctuation | trim %][% END %]
[% IF hold.item.itemcallnumber %]  Call number [% hold.item.itemcallnumber %]
[% END %][% IF hold.expirationdate %]  Collect by [% hold.expirationdate | $KohaDates %]
[% END %]  At [% hold.branch.branchname %][% IF hold.branch.branchaddress1 %], [% hold.branch.branchaddress1 %][% END %][% IF hold.branch.branchcity %], [% hold.branch.branchcity %][% END %]
----

[% IF Koha.Preference('OPACBaseURL') -%]
Please cancel what you no longer need so that the next reader can have it: [% Koha.Preference('OPACBaseURL') %]/cgi-bin/koha/opac-user.pl

[% END -%]
Thank you,
[% library_name %]
[% IF footer_note %][% footer_note %][% END %]
